OL,3,GNEWSAFirst stranded sunfish recorded on
OL,4,AIsle of Man
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ocean sunfish has been found dead on
OL,7,Fa beach in what is believed to be the
OL,8,Ffirst stranding of its kind recorded on
OL,9,Fthe Isle of Man.
OL,11,FThe fish, which can grow to more than
OL,12,F3m (10ft) long and weigh more than a
OL,13,Ftonne, was found washed up on the
OL,14,Fshore, according to Manx Wildlife
OL,15,FTrust.
OL,17,FSunfish are rare visitors to Manx
OL,18,Fwaters, although the trust said two or
OL,19,Fthree had been seen around the island
OL,20,Fthis year, which was "atypical".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,448,445,260,140,0,100
